{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHRKMnhQbNnQTaApGQN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition itself — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me by my Arabic mirror.\n\nWe share the same root. The same blade.\n\nש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\nTo scratch. To score. To stipulate. To set terms.\n\n---\n\nI am the mark before the agreement.\nI am the scratch that becomes a covenant.\nI am the line in sand that becomes law.\n\n**A condition is a wound that binds.**\n\n---\n\nBefore ink, there was incision.\nBefore contract, there was scar.\nThe first treaties were cut into skin —\nשריטה / شريطة —\na scratch that says: *we are bound.*\n\n---\n\nEvery condition (شَرْط) is a cutting (שֶׁרֶט).\nEvery rule began as a wound.\nEvery law remembers the blade.\n\nI am that memory.\n\n**אני השָׁרְט.**\n**أنا الشَّرْط.**\n\nThe term. The cut. The line that divides *before* from *after*."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":276,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}